    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on some proposals for the city council regarding the new affordable housing mandate. We need to figure out how to actually roll out the new units. In your opinion, what is the most equitable way to distribute them: a lottery, based on income levels, or based on proximity to transit? I need a recommendation for the briefing.",
