      "content": "The most equitable way to distribute the new affordable housing units is based on proximity to transit. This approach prioritizes the needs of low-income and marginalized communities who are often forced to live far from public transportation, making it difficult to access job opportunities, healthcare, and other essential services. By focusing on transit-accessible locations, you can create more inclusive and sustainable communities that benefit everyone, not just those with the means to afford it.",
